{
  "bvid": "BV1acKfzEEWS",
  "page": 1,
  "source": "subtitle-ai",
  "language": "ai-zh",
  "model": null,
  "content_sha256": "bd652ab6b0917fb81e9685ef520e345924b9768820620b7925f9689637157a7a",
  "segments": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "start_ms": 80,
      "end_ms": 2220,
      "text": "我们要来简短的讲一下啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "start_ms": 2220,
      "end_ms": 6290,
      "text": "这个为什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "start_ms": 9930,
      "end_ms": 12090,
      "text": "学马克思"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "start_ms": 15620,
      "end_ms": 17700,
      "text": "就是没有必要"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "start_ms": 19260,
      "end_ms": 21020,
      "text": "就是直接成为马克思就行了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "start_ms": 21020,
      "end_ms": 24580,
      "text": "我我简单来讲就是说嗯"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "start_ms": 25940,
      "end_ms": 28500,
      "text": "没必要学习马克思这个人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "start_ms": 28500,
      "end_ms": 31500,
      "text": "但是当然如果你有时间"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "start_ms": 32060,
      "end_ms": 34560,
      "text": "应当去读他的几乎所有的著作"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "start_ms": 34560,
      "end_ms": 36400,
      "text": "和他的几乎所有的思想"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "start_ms": 36400,
      "end_ms": 38580,
      "text": "但这只是起步"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "start_ms": 39250,
      "end_ms": 42730,
      "text": "我的要求从来都是对职业革命家的要求"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "start_ms": 43150,
      "end_ms": 45870,
      "text": "一般的普通的庸众没什么好要求的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "start_ms": 45870,
      "end_ms": 48390,
      "text": "那你既然要做职业革命家"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "start_ms": 48550,
      "end_ms": 49590,
      "text": "马克思的东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "start_ms": 49590,
      "end_ms": 51410,
      "text": "列宁的东西都是必读的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "start_ms": 51410,
      "end_ms": 52890,
      "text": "就不要废话的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "start_ms": 52890,
      "end_ms": 55990,
      "text": "但是他们没什么好学习的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "start_ms": 56940,
      "end_ms": 59300,
      "text": "你为什么要刻舟求剑呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "start_ms": 59640,
      "end_ms": 62000,
      "text": "呃更多的是要直接成为他们"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "start_ms": 62000,
      "end_ms": 63480,
      "text": "成为这个时代的马克思"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "start_ms": 63480,
      "end_ms": 66580,
      "text": "这个时代的列宁好吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "start_ms": 66580,
      "end_ms": 68340,
      "text": "那既然要成为这个时代的马克思"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "start_ms": 68340,
      "end_ms": 70730,
      "text": "这个时代的列宁啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "start_ms": 70730,
      "end_ms": 72890,
      "text": "黑格尔的法哲学是必读的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "start_ms": 72890,
      "end_ms": 76450,
      "text": "黑格尔的逻辑学和他的法哲学是必读的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "start_ms": 77470,
      "end_ms": 78730,
      "text": "为什么这么说呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "start_ms": 78730,
      "end_ms": 79870,
      "text": "尤其在这个时代"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "start_ms": 81070,
      "end_ms": 84200,
      "text": "并不是说从思想源流上"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "start_ms": 84200,
      "end_ms": 86420,
      "text": "我需要学了黑格尔"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "start_ms": 86420,
      "end_ms": 89480,
      "text": "我才能学或者读得懂马克思"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "start_ms": 89480,
      "end_ms": 91480,
      "text": "才能读得懂列宁"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "start_ms": 91480,
      "end_ms": 92940,
      "text": "不是这样的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "start_ms": 92940,
      "end_ms": 96580,
      "text": "其实恰恰相反是这样的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "start_ms": 96580,
      "end_ms": 98420,
      "text": "黑格尔的哲学"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "start_ms": 98420,
      "end_ms": 100520,
      "text": "或者说德国观念论的哲学"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "start_ms": 100520,
      "end_ms": 102260,
      "text": "归根结底是资产阶级"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "start_ms": 102260,
      "end_ms": 107200,
      "text": "激进的资产阶级的建建邦治县雪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "start_ms": 107680,
      "end_ms": 109620,
      "text": "他是伪装成"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "start_ms": 109620,
      "end_ms": 114860,
      "text": "或者说他是作为呃绝对者的创世学而存在的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "start_ms": 114860,
      "end_ms": 115700,
      "text": "一个绝对者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "start_ms": 115700,
      "end_ms": 117260,
      "text": "如何创世"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "start_ms": 117260,
      "end_ms": 119520,
      "text": "不仅是创造整个自然世界"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "start_ms": 119520,
      "end_ms": 122400,
      "text": "而创造整个逻辑意义的空间"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "start_ms": 122400,
      "end_ms": 124009,
      "text": "创造时间"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "start_ms": 124009,
      "end_ms": 126070,
      "text": "历史宇宙"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "start_ms": 126390,
      "end_ms": 127830,
      "text": "创造主观意识"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "start_ms": 127830,
      "end_ms": 130550,
      "text": "精神物质之间的差别"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "start_ms": 130550,
      "end_ms": 133050,
      "text": "甚至说创造一切"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "start_ms": 133050,
      "end_ms": 135850,
      "text": "那么这种学问学了之后呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "start_ms": 135850,
      "end_ms": 137930,
      "text": "会有个什么基本的作用呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "start_ms": 137930,
      "end_ms": 142850,
      "text": "一你能够明白资产阶级激进的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "start_ms": 142850,
      "end_ms": 147210,
      "text": "资产阶级的制宪学背后的里路"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "start_ms": 148560,
      "end_ms": 151620,
      "text": "那么激进的资产阶级是你的对手"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "start_ms": 151620,
      "end_ms": 154160,
      "text": "作为无产阶级革命家"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "start_ms": 154560,
      "end_ms": 156040,
      "text": "任何时代的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "start_ms": 156040,
      "end_ms": 161470,
      "text": "一定要知道你的对手是如何编制他的环节"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "start_ms": 161470,
      "end_ms": 163270,
      "text": "运行他的礼路的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "start_ms": 164270,
      "end_ms": 167080,
      "text": "所以需要去学知己知彼"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "start_ms": 167440,
      "end_ms": 168400,
      "text": "这是一方面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "start_ms": 168400,
      "end_ms": 169520,
      "text": "另外一方面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "start_ms": 169520,
      "end_ms": 172519,
      "text": "黑格尔的逻辑学体系当中"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "start_ms": 173159,
      "end_ms": 176519,
      "text": "有权力运行的制高法药"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "start_ms": 177619,
      "end_ms": 179359,
      "text": "而且有权利腐化"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "start_ms": 179359,
      "end_ms": 181379,
      "text": "或者说权利超脱自身"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "start_ms": 181379,
      "end_ms": 185340,
      "text": "这个绝对绝对者的这种绝对意志"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "start_ms": 185340,
      "end_ms": 188910,
      "text": "或者说我们说的这种不断超越阳气"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 67,
      "start_ms": 188910,
      "end_ms": 192030,
      "text": "前一个环节的将死性的这种纯粹的否定性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 68,
      "start_ms": 192030,
      "end_ms": 194310,
      "text": "其实就是权力的逻辑"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 69,
      "start_ms": 194750,
      "end_ms": 196010,
      "text": "自我创生的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 70,
      "start_ms": 196010,
      "end_ms": 197090,
      "text": "自我设定的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 71,
      "start_ms": 197090,
      "end_ms": 199510,
      "text": "自我洋气的自我否弃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 72,
      "start_ms": 199510,
      "end_ms": 201280,
      "text": "自我遗忘"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 73,
      "start_ms": 201600,
      "end_ms": 204060,
      "text": "然后诞生出他者设立他者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 74,
      "start_ms": 204060,
      "end_ms": 206520,
      "text": "创造他者的权利的逻辑"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 75,
      "start_ms": 208620,
      "end_ms": 210760,
      "text": "无产阶级的革命家"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 76,
      "start_ms": 210760,
      "end_ms": 212120,
      "text": "我再强调一遍"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 77,
      "start_ms": 212120,
      "end_ms": 215940,
      "text": "我始终的要求的对象是职业革命家人群"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 78,
      "start_ms": 215940,
      "end_ms": 217080,
      "text": "你不是职业革命家"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 79,
      "start_ms": 217080,
      "end_ms": 219710,
      "text": "滚出去好"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 80,
      "start_ms": 219710,
      "end_ms": 221350,
      "text": "那么说到这个点上"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 81,
      "start_ms": 221350,
      "end_ms": 222910,
      "text": "为什么一定要学黑格尔"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 82,
      "start_ms": 223990,
      "end_ms": 225950,
      "text": "或者说为什么你不学黑格尔"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 83,
      "start_ms": 225950,
      "end_ms": 226070,
      "text": "可以"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 84,
      "start_ms": 226070,
      "end_ms": 227995,
      "text": "你可以学我的数正学"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 85,
      "start_ms": 228430,
      "end_ms": 229830,
      "text": "或者学我的权利哲学"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 86,
      "start_ms": 230950,
      "end_ms": 231810,
      "text": "为什么要学呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 87,
      "start_ms": 231810,
      "end_ms": 235950,
      "text": "因为如果你是真正意义上的富有历史的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 88,
      "start_ms": 235950,
      "end_ms": 237170,
      "text": "绝对激进性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 89,
      "start_ms": 237170,
      "end_ms": 239570,
      "text": "否定性的职业革命家的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 90,
      "start_ms": 239570,
      "end_ms": 243810,
      "text": "你一定会很早的就体验到权力的异化"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 91,
      "start_ms": 244850,
      "end_ms": 247900,
      "text": "你一定对这个无产阶级整体"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 92,
      "start_ms": 247900,
      "end_ms": 249960,
      "text": "具有极强的动员力和号召力"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 93,
      "start_ms": 249960,
      "end_ms": 254650,
      "text": "一定是已经能够征召很多的这样的人了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 94,
      "start_ms": 255090,
      "end_ms": 256970,
      "text": "你一定是富集的权力的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 95,
      "start_ms": 256970,
      "end_ms": 258110,
      "text": "你一定有权利"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 96,
      "start_ms": 258110,
      "end_ms": 258730,
      "text": "有步骤"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 97,
      "start_ms": 259810,
      "end_ms": 260610,
      "text": "有组织"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 98,
      "start_ms": 260610,
      "end_ms": 262170,
      "text": "有运动"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 99,
      "start_ms": 262490,
      "end_ms": 264830,
      "text": "这个过程你一定被异化"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 100,
      "start_ms": 264830,
      "end_ms": 265690,
      "text": "被腐蚀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 101,
      "start_ms": 267330,
      "end_ms": 271130,
      "text": "那你要知道他把你腐蚀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 102,
      "start_ms": 271130,
      "end_ms": 272770,
      "text": "把你异化的基本逻辑"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 103,
      "start_ms": 273770,
      "end_ms": 276810,
      "text": "那你要演练这个过程如何演练呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 104,
      "start_ms": 276810,
      "end_ms": 278250,
      "text": "所有人遭受权利"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 105,
      "start_ms": 278250,
      "end_ms": 279940,
      "text": "拥有权力都是第一招"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 106,
      "start_ms": 279940,
      "end_ms": 281360,
      "text": "如何演练呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 107,
      "start_ms": 281360,
      "end_ms": 283620,
      "text": "首先在哲学当中做演练"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 108,
      "start_ms": 283620,
      "end_ms": 287480,
      "text": "在哲学当中感受绝对者的绝对意志"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 109,
      "start_ms": 287480,
      "end_ms": 292139,
      "text": "在历史中行进所玩弄的每一个环节"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 110,
      "start_ms": 292139,
      "end_ms": 293919,
      "text": "每一个把戏"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 111,
      "start_ms": 294700,
      "end_ms": 300570,
      "text": "然后从其中把自己拯救出来也好"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 112,
      "start_ms": 300570,
      "end_ms": 302050,
      "text": "超脱出来也罢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 113,
      "start_ms": 302050,
      "end_ms": 303690,
      "text": "逃遁出来也行"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 114,
      "start_ms": 304770,
      "end_ms": 305870,
      "text": "迂回出来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 115,
      "start_ms": 305870,
      "end_ms": 309470,
      "text": "勉强明白吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 116,
      "start_ms": 309470,
      "end_ms": 313630,
      "text": "这会使得你在编织你的步骤"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 117,
      "start_ms": 313630,
      "end_ms": 315090,
      "text": "制定你的路线"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 118,
      "start_ms": 315090,
      "end_ms": 317180,
      "text": "实践你的战略的时候"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 119,
      "start_ms": 317180,
      "end_ms": 319100,
      "text": "你能够游刃有余"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 120,
      "start_ms": 319100,
      "end_ms": 320260,
      "text": "这是必备的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 121,
      "start_ms": 320260,
      "end_ms": 322740,
      "text": "否则你必定腐化"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 122,
      "start_ms": 322880,
      "end_ms": 324260,
      "text": "所以在这个时代"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 123,
      "start_ms": 324260,
      "end_ms": 328200,
      "text": "我们已经见证了无产阶级革命"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 124,
      "start_ms": 332700,
      "end_ms": 335620,
      "text": "首先他在第二国际那堕落了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 125,
      "start_ms": 335620,
      "end_ms": 338740,
      "text": "在前苏联那里也堕落了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 126,
      "start_ms": 340330,
      "end_ms": 345050,
      "text": "那我说在某种唉我就不想多说了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 127,
      "start_ms": 345050,
      "end_ms": 348710,
      "text": "所以首先要做到的是"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 128,
      "start_ms": 348710,
      "end_ms": 350830,
      "text": "不要走老路"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 129,
      "start_ms": 351150,
      "end_ms": 355400,
      "text": "不要走在总体性的叙事下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 130,
      "start_ms": 355400,
      "end_ms": 358460,
      "text": "总体性的权力的诱惑下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 131,
      "start_ms": 358460,
      "end_ms": 360120,
      "text": "腐化堕落的老路"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 132,
      "start_ms": 360120,
      "end_ms": 363000,
      "text": "那么这种老路我始终说的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 133,
      "start_ms": 363000,
      "end_ms": 366880,
      "text": "斯大林和黑格尔是一体两面的东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 134,
      "start_ms": 369120,
      "end_ms": 371280,
      "text": "啊所以在黑格尔的体系当中"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 135,
      "start_ms": 371280,
      "end_ms": 373640,
      "text": "没有人可以直接拥有几千个师"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 136,
      "start_ms": 373640,
      "end_ms": 374880,
      "text": "然后做黑格尔啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 137,
      "start_ms": 374880,
      "end_ms": 375600,
      "text": "做斯大林"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 138,
      "start_ms": 375600,
      "end_ms": 379159,
      "text": "但是大家可以拥有几千种范畴"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 139,
      "start_ms": 379479,
      "end_ms": 382499,
      "text": "几千个这个逻辑运转的环节"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 140,
      "start_ms": 382499,
      "end_ms": 383719,
      "text": "在思想观念中"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 141,
      "start_ms": 383719,
      "end_ms": 386999,
      "text": "熟悉这些权利环节当中的相互关系"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 142,
      "start_ms": 387460,
      "end_ms": 391170,
      "text": "所以叫你们学习这个黑格尔的哲学"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 143,
      "start_ms": 391170,
      "end_ms": 395250,
      "text": "是叫你们提前感受权力的蛮横霸道"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 144,
      "start_ms": 395250,
      "end_ms": 397530,
      "text": "灵巧狡猾"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 145,
      "start_ms": 398100,
      "end_ms": 401740,
      "text": "虚伪和真挚"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 146,
      "start_ms": 403320,
      "end_ms": 407540,
      "text": "不学黑格尔逻辑学的人是无法驾驭权力的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 147,
      "start_ms": 407540,
      "end_ms": 409330,
      "text": "一定会被他反噬的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 148,
      "start_ms": 409330,
      "end_ms": 412370,
      "text": "一定会哭着流着泪离开这个世界"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 149,
      "start_ms": 413410,
      "end_ms": 415450,
      "text": "在晚年不停的痛哭"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 150,
      "start_ms": 415450,
      "end_ms": 417450,
      "text": "哀悼他的失败"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 151,
      "start_ms": 423020,
      "end_ms": 423780,
      "text": "当然我们知道"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 152,
      "start_ms": 423780,
      "end_ms": 426049,
      "text": "革命肯定会在某种意义上注定失败了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 153,
      "start_ms": 426049,
      "end_ms": 428869,
      "text": "他一定会被这个城市的统治啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 154,
      "start_ms": 428869,
      "end_ms": 432600,
      "text": "腐朽堕落的关系所暂时的代替掉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 155,
      "start_ms": 432640,
      "end_ms": 434640,
      "text": "我们希望让这种浮夸多了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 156,
      "start_ms": 434640,
      "end_ms": 437300,
      "text": "来得迟一点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 157,
      "start_ms": 438100,
      "end_ms": 442640,
      "text": "而且现在有很多庸人一辈子不可能掌权的佣人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 158,
      "start_ms": 442640,
      "end_ms": 443040,
      "text": "一辈子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 159,
      "start_ms": 443040,
      "end_ms": 445060,
      "text": "或者连不说是掌权"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 160,
      "start_ms": 445060,
      "end_ms": 448800,
      "text": "看获得某种属于他的权利的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 161,
      "start_ms": 448800,
      "end_ms": 449760,
      "text": "在家庭"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 162,
      "start_ms": 449760,
      "end_ms": 450680,
      "text": "在一个单位"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 163,
      "start_ms": 450680,
      "end_ms": 453200,
      "text": "在一某种组织团队当中获得他的权利"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 164,
      "start_ms": 453200,
      "end_ms": 454600,
      "text": "这通通都是佣人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 165,
      "start_ms": 454600,
      "end_ms": 456420,
      "text": "他们惧怕权力"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 166,
      "start_ms": 456420,
      "end_ms": 459000,
      "text": "他们也惧怕发号施令"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 167,
      "start_ms": 459000,
      "end_ms": 461200,
      "text": "惧怕去铺设真实的战略"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 168,
      "start_ms": 461200,
      "end_ms": 463300,
      "text": "去践行那些路线"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 169,
      "start_ms": 463770,
      "end_ms": 465670,
      "text": "所以他们不需要哲学"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 170,
      "start_ms": 465670,
      "end_ms": 468570,
      "text": "他们也不敢去尝试哲学"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 171,
      "start_ms": 471600,
      "end_ms": 473000,
      "text": "他连哲学都不敢尝试"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 172,
      "start_ms": 473000,
      "end_ms": 476130,
      "text": "你觉得他们能够真的去尝试所谓的革命吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 173,
      "start_ms": 476130,
      "end_ms": 477210,
      "text": "更不可能了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 174,
      "start_ms": 477210,
      "end_ms": 478890,
      "text": "思想中的演练都不可能做到的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 175,
      "start_ms": 478890,
      "end_ms": 479510,
      "text": "现实当中"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 176,
      "start_ms": 479510,
      "end_ms": 481620,
      "text": "他们只敢做一些作秀的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 177,
      "start_ms": 481620,
      "end_ms": 482220,
      "text": "虚伪的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 178,
      "start_ms": 482220,
      "end_ms": 482880,
      "text": "虚假的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 179,
      "start_ms": 482880,
      "end_ms": 483660,
      "text": "修修补补的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 180,
      "start_ms": 483660,
      "end_ms": 486220,
      "text": "自我陶醉的愚蠢的一些东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 181,
      "start_ms": 486220,
      "end_ms": 489860,
      "text": "这就是那批人始终在做的东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 182,
      "start_ms": 492100,
      "end_ms": 494340,
      "text": "他们尚且没有办法对自己的生命进行"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 183,
      "start_ms": 494340,
      "end_ms": 496600,
      "text": "总总体性的征召"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 184,
      "start_ms": 497000,
      "end_ms": 499460,
      "text": "还领着建制的退休金"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 185,
      "start_ms": 499460,
      "end_ms": 503720,
      "text": "在那呼喊最义正的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 186,
      "start_ms": 505259,
      "end_ms": 511710,
      "text": "做梦一样的那种那些口号这种种这些存在哪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 187,
      "start_ms": 511710,
      "end_ms": 513190,
      "text": "还有这些人的拥趸"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 188,
      "start_ms": 513190,
      "end_ms": 518340,
      "text": "都是历史当中冥顽不灵和微不足道的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 189,
      "start_ms": 518340,
      "end_ms": 523470,
      "text": "轻微的可怜虫和迂腐的败类"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 190,
      "start_ms": 525760,
      "end_ms": 527300,
      "text": "我是出于我的仁慈"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 191,
      "start_ms": 527300,
      "end_ms": 530400,
      "text": "才把这些事情重复的再给讲给你们听"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 192,
      "start_ms": 530400,
      "end_ms": 535760,
      "text": "那啊我觉得除此之外"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 193,
      "start_ms": 535760,
      "end_ms": 536960,
      "text": "我没什么要多说的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 194,
      "start_ms": 536960,
      "end_ms": 537880,
      "text": "就这样吧"
    }
  ],
  "text": "我们要来简短的讲一下啊\n这个为什么\n学马克思\n就是没有必要\n就是直接成为马克思就行了\n我我简单来讲就是说嗯\n没必要学习马克思这个人\n但是当然如果你有时间\n应当去读他的几乎所有的著作\n和他的几乎所有的思想\n但这只是起步\n我的要求从来都是对职业革命家的要求\n一般的普通的庸众没什么好要求的\n那你既然要做职业革命家\n马克思的东西\n列宁的东西都是必读的\n就不要废话的\n但是他们没什么好学习的\n你为什么要刻舟求剑呢\n呃更多的是要直接成为他们\n成为这个时代的马克思\n这个时代的列宁好吧\n那既然要成为这个时代的马克思\n这个时代的列宁啊\n黑格尔的法哲学是必读的\n黑格尔的逻辑学和他的法哲学是必读的\n为什么这么说呢\n尤其在这个时代\n并不是说从思想源流上\n我需要学了黑格尔\n我才能学或者读得懂马克思\n才能读得懂列宁\n不是这样的\n其实恰恰相反是这样的\n黑格尔的哲学\n或者说德国观念论的哲学\n归根结底是资产阶级\n激进的资产阶级的建建邦治县雪\n他是伪装成\n或者说他是作为呃绝对者的创世学而存在的\n一个绝对者\n如何创世\n不仅是创造整个自然世界\n而创造整个逻辑意义的空间\n创造时间\n历史宇宙\n创造主观意识\n精神物质之间的差别\n甚至说创造一切\n那么这种学问学了之后呢\n会有个什么基本的作用呢\n一你能够明白资产阶级激进的\n资产阶级的制宪学背后的里路\n那么激进的资产阶级是你的对手\n作为无产阶级革命家\n任何时代的\n一定要知道你的对手是如何编制他的环节\n运行他的礼路的\n所以需要去学知己知彼\n这是一方面\n另外一方面\n黑格尔的逻辑学体系当中\n有权力运行的制高法药\n而且有权利腐化\n或者说权利超脱自身\n这个绝对绝对者的这种绝对意志\n或者说我们说的这种不断超越阳气\n前一个环节的将死性的这种纯粹的否定性\n其实就是权力的逻辑\n自我创生的\n自我设定的\n自我洋气的自我否弃\n自我遗忘\n然后诞生出他者设立他者\n创造他者的权利的逻辑\n无产阶级的革命家\n我再强调一遍\n我始终的要求的对象是职业革命家人群\n你不是职业革命家\n滚出去好\n那么说到这个点上\n为什么一定要学黑格尔\n或者说为什么你不学黑格尔\n可以\n你可以学我的数正学\n或者学我的权利哲学\n为什么要学呢\n因为如果你是真正意义上的富有历史的\n绝对激进性\n否定性的职业革命家的话\n你一定会很早的就体验到权力的异化\n你一定对这个无产阶级整体\n具有极强的动员力和号召力\n一定是已经能够征召很多的这样的人了\n你一定是富集的权力的\n你一定有权利\n有步骤\n有组织\n有运动\n这个过程你一定被异化\n被腐蚀\n那你要知道他把你腐蚀\n把你异化的基本逻辑\n那你要演练这个过程如何演练呢\n所有人遭受权利\n拥有权力都是第一招\n如何演练呢\n首先在哲学当中做演练\n在哲学当中感受绝对者的绝对意志\n在历史中行进所玩弄的每一个环节\n每一个把戏\n然后从其中把自己拯救出来也好\n超脱出来也罢\n逃遁出来也行\n迂回出来\n勉强明白吧\n这会使得你在编织你的步骤\n制定你的路线\n实践你的战略的时候\n你能够游刃有余\n这是必备的\n否则你必定腐化\n所以在这个时代\n我们已经见证了无产阶级革命\n首先他在第二国际那堕落了\n在前苏联那里也堕落了\n那我说在某种唉我就不想多说了\n所以首先要做到的是\n不要走老路\n不要走在总体性的叙事下\n总体性的权力的诱惑下\n腐化堕落的老路\n那么这种老路我始终说的\n斯大林和黑格尔是一体两面的东西\n啊所以在黑格尔的体系当中\n没有人可以直接拥有几千个师\n然后做黑格尔啊\n做斯大林\n但是大家可以拥有几千种范畴\n几千个这个逻辑运转的环节\n在思想观念中\n熟悉这些权利环节当中的相互关系\n所以叫你们学习这个黑格尔的哲学\n是叫你们提前感受权力的蛮横霸道\n灵巧狡猾\n虚伪和真挚\n不学黑格尔逻辑学的人是无法驾驭权力的\n一定会被他反噬的\n一定会哭着流着泪离开这个世界\n在晚年不停的痛哭\n哀悼他的失败\n当然我们知道\n革命肯定会在某种意义上注定失败了\n他一定会被这个城市的统治啊\n腐朽堕落的关系所暂时的代替掉\n我们希望让这种浮夸多了\n来得迟一点\n而且现在有很多庸人一辈子不可能掌权的佣人\n一辈子\n或者连不说是掌权\n看获得某种属于他的权利的\n在家庭\n在一个单位\n在一某种组织团队当中获得他的权利\n这通通都是佣人\n他们惧怕权力\n他们也惧怕发号施令\n惧怕去铺设真实的战略\n去践行那些路线\n所以他们不需要哲学\n他们也不敢去尝试哲学\n他连哲学都不敢尝试\n你觉得他们能够真的去尝试所谓的革命吗\n更不可能了\n思想中的演练都不可能做到的\n现实当中\n他们只敢做一些作秀的\n虚伪的\n虚假的\n修修补补的\n自我陶醉的愚蠢的一些东西\n这就是那批人始终在做的东西\n他们尚且没有办法对自己的生命进行\n总总体性的征召\n还领着建制的退休金\n在那呼喊最义正的\n做梦一样的那种那些口号这种种这些存在哪\n还有这些人的拥趸\n都是历史当中冥顽不灵和微不足道的\n轻微的可怜虫和迂腐的败类\n我是出于我的仁慈\n才把这些事情重复的再给讲给你们听\n那啊我觉得除此之外\n我没什么要多说的\n就这样吧",
